  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">POL Aktiv arb-marknadspol</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">POL Labour Market Policy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet utg&#xf6;rs av studiebes&#xf6;k, seminarier och utbildning f&#xf6;r representanter f&#xf6;r arbetsmarknadsadministrationen p&#xe5; central, regionaloch lokal niv&#xe5;. Syftet &#xe4;r att implementera en aktiv arbetsmarknads- politik i fem utvalda voivods i Polen, genom att bl a utveckla metod och organisation p&#xe5; arbetsf&#xf6;rmedlingarna.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The projects comprises study visits, seminars and training for representatives for Labour Market Administration from central, regional and local level. The aim is the implementation of an active Labour Market Policy in five selected voivodships in Poland, by developing placement service and management.</narrative>
  </description>
